<title>AUSTRIA: Austria central bank '96 net profit down 10.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria central bank '96 net profit down 10.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank on Thursday posted a net profit of 7.54 billion schillings in 1996, down from 8.35 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit for 1996 fell to 10.63 billion schillings from last year's 12.17 billion.</p>
<p>The bank paid 8.4 billion schillings or 73.6 percent of its earnings to the state in 1996, down from 9.3 billion in 1995, it said.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
